      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_4",
        on: "start",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: "wesnoth-icon.png",
            text: _("After several hours of hard travel the party arrived at the battle scene."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("Sisal, how do you fare?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("Your Highness! You are here! How fares Hidel?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("(<i>Sheds a tear</i>)"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("Hidel... died a hero’s death, one worthy to be sung forever."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("The dung-spawned bastards! Verily, had it not been for Hidel we would all be dead and Rakshas would be gleefully counting his gold."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("Hidel and a handful of elves held off the orcs for more than an hour. That was enough time for us to make off with the gold and rally here at these ruins."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("So you have the gold?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("We have the gold, and now we shall have the blood of these orcs! IN HIDEL’S NAME!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("Grrr, Ha’Tuil has never failed in his mission. I will soon lay your severed heads at the feet of the Master!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("You will eat cold steel and whimper your way to hell, foul wretch of an orc!"),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_5",
        on: "last_breath",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "filter_condition",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "predicate",
                name: "wml_filter",
                unit: "$last_dead_id",
                filter: "%7B%22tag%22%3A%22filter%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22id%22%3A%22Ha'Tuil%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("Argh! I have failed!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("Cheer up — you won’t have to live with your failure for long... (<i>Snicker</i>)"),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_6",
        on: "last_breath",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "filter_condition",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "predicate",
                name: "wml_filter",
                unit: "$last_dead_id",
                filter: "%7B%22tag%22%3A%22filter%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22id%22%3A%22Sisal%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:play_music",
            file: "sad.ogg",
            play_once: "yes",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("Ahhhh! Farewell, friends. I now go to join Hidel."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("Sisal! Noooo!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("Haha! We got the gold now!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("Hahaha! Mission accomplished! I’ll send a wolf to the Master to deliver the gold. Now let’s crush the rest of this scum!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("I don’t think so, you bastard orcs! That gold belongs to us. Besides, we now have a few scores to settle with you. Take them, troops! I want no orc left alive!"),
          },
        ],
      },
